{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant architecture: employees reach an AgentCore agent that queries Qwen via Model Studio, grounded in your docs stored in OSS and indexed in Milvus."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internal","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internal","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"sg","why":"Hosts the internal assistant agent with skills and tools."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentcore","from":"users","to":"agentcore","label":"chat"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Runs Qwen models for answering questions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-llm","from":"agentcore","to":"llm","label":"LLM calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus vector store","group":"sg","why":"Stores embeddings of policy docs and wiki pages for retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-vector","from":"agentcore","to":"vector","label":"RAG search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document store","group":"sg","why":"Holds raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-vector","from":"docs","to":"vector","label":"ingest","kind":"async"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"Ready-made workplace agent if you prefer no custom build."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Internal RAG assistant using AgentCore, Model Studio (Qwen), Milvus for vector search and OSS for document storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a data platform in Singapore: DTS replicates MySQL to MaxCompute for nightly batch, with Hologres serving Quick BI dashboards."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","rds","dts","maxcompute","dataworks","hologres","quick-bi","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Business users","group":"internet","why":"View dashboards and reports."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"orders-db","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Source transactional order database."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS sync","group":"vpc","why":"Real-time CDC replication to warehouse."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-orders-dts","from":"orders-db","to":"dts","label":"CDC","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"maxcompute","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute warehouse","group":"sg","why":"Stores replicated data for nightly batch analytics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-maxcompute","from":"dts","to":"maxcompute","label":"sync","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dataworks","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks scheduler","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates nightly ETL jobs over MaxCompute."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-maxcompute","from":"dataworks","to":"maxcompute","label":"batch ETL","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"hologres","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres serving layer","group":"sg","why":"Fast interactive queries for dashboard serving."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-maxcompute-hologres","from":"maxcompute","to":"hologres","label":"load","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"quickbi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI dashboards","group":"sg","why":"BI reports and dashboards for business users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-hologres-quickbi","from":"hologres","to":"quickbi","label":"query","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-quickbi","from":"users","to":"quickbi","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logging for pipeline monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-logs","from":"dataworks","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Data platform: RDS MySQL replicated via DTS to MaxCompute, DataWorks nightly batch, Hologres serving Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a Kubernetes architecture with ACK, an API gateway, MSE for discovery, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"Clients calling the microservices platform."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the platform domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Single API entry point routing to 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices on Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","why":"Service discovery and configuration for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","why":"Async messaging between microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared cache for fast data access."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database with compute-storage separation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs for observability."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Kubernetes microservices platform with ACK, API Gateway, MSE Nacos, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with HTTPDNS for the mobile app."}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","httpdns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","fc","tair","tablestore","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"clients","kind":"external","label":"Clients","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile App","group":"clients","why":"End users calling the REST API from their phones."}
{"t":"node","id":"httpdns","product":"httpdns","label":"HTTPDNS","group":null,"why":"Prevents DNS hijacking and improves routing for mobile clients."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-httpdns","from":"app","to":"httpdns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates API requests at the edge with DDoS protection."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes, throttles and authenticates REST API calls serverlessly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gw","from":"esa","to":"gw","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API Functions","group":"vpc","why":"Runs REST handlers; scales to zero so you pay only per request."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api","label":"invoke"}
{"t":"say","text":"Data layer uses Tair for hot cache, Tablestore for serverless NoSQL storage, and OSS for files."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Hot Cache","group":"vpc","why":"Caches frequent reads to absorb traffic spikes cheaply."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"NoSQL Store","group":"vpc","why":"Serverless wide-column store that auto-scales with spiky writes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"files","product":"oss","label":"File Storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores user uploads and static assets without managing servers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-files","from":"api","to":"files","label":"objects"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding SLS for centralized logging and monitoring of all functions."}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs & Metrics","group":"sg","why":"Collects function logs and metrics for debugging and alerting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API with FC, Cloud-native API Gateway, ESA, Tair, Tablestore and OSS for spiky mobile traffic."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline in Singapore using IoT Platform, Kafka, Flink, Lindorm and DataV."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","lindorm","datav","sls","clickhouse"]}
{"t":"group","id":"field","kind":"external","label":"Field","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100k IoT devices","group":"field","why":"Sends telemetry every few seconds to the cloud."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"vpc","why":"Ingests MQTT telemetry from 100k devices and routes it."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot","from":"devices","to":"iot","label":"MQTT"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry for stream processing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-kafka","from":"iot","to":"kafka","label":"telemetry","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Detects anomalies in real time over the telemetry stream."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"stream","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"lindorm","product":"lindorm","label":"Lindorm","group":"vpc","why":"Stores time-series telemetry at massive write scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-lindorm","from":"flink","to":"lindorm","label":"metrics"}
{"t":"node","id":"clickhouse","product":"clickhouse","label":"ClickHouse","group":"vpc","why":"Holds anomaly events for fast dashboard queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-clickhouse","from":"flink","to":"clickhouse","label":"anomalies"}
{"t":"node","id":"datav","product":"datav","label":"DataV dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Live visualization of device health and anomalies."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-clickhouse-datav","from":"clickhouse","to":"datav","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes pipeline logs and triggers alert rules."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"alerts","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time IoT pipeline: IoT Platform ingests 100k devices into Kafka, Flink detects anomalies, Lindorm stores metrics, ClickHouse serves DataV dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB, WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30,000 daily users browsing the store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches pages and accelerates dynamic traffic across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Spreads traffic across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots during sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales instances up during big sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both multi-zone for resilience."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast across zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders with a zone standby for HA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logs and alerts for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB+WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair cache and multi-zone RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"For 25 developers needing an agentic coding assistant with SSO and admin controls, Qoder Teams is the right fit."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Agentic coding platform for teams with SSO, privacy mode, admin dashboard and usage analytics."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Provides per-member model keys so your team can use Qwen inside their existing coding tools."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-enterprise","fit":"complement","why":"Upgrade path if you later need billing groups, model routing policies or audit logs at scale."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary agentic coding assistant for your 25 developers, with Token Plan for model access."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a team of 15 developers, Qoder Teams provides shared seats, SSO and usage analytics for coding agents."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Team coding agent seats with admin controls and privacy mode for 15 developers."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Per-member API keys so each developer can use Qwen models inside their IDE."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary coding agent platform for your 15 developers, complemented by Token Plan for model access."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a company-wide AI assistant that handles documents, slides and research, QwenWork is the ready-made workplace agent."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"primary","why":"All-in-one workplace agent for docs, slides, sheets, web pages and video across every department."}
{"t":"rec","product":"dingtalk","fit":"complement","why":"International enterprise messaging suite that links directly to QwenWork so staff chat with it daily."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommend QwenWork as the primary company-wide AI assistant, complemented by DingTalk for everyday access."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw your Singapore data center connected via Express Connect, with SMC and DTS for a step-by-step VM migration."}
{"t":"req","text":"Connect on-premises data center in Singapore to Alibaba Cloud privately"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","cen","transit-router","vpc","ecs","ebs","smc","dts","sls","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"external","label":"On-premises DC","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"Singapore Data Center","group":"onprem","why":"Your existing data center hosting the VMs to migrate."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"ec","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"sg","why":"Dedicated private link from your DC into the Alibaba Cloud VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec","from":"dc","to":"ec","label":"private link","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"cen","product":"cen","label":"CEN","group":null,"why":"Global network backbone linking the VPC and hybrid connections."}
{"t":"node","id":"tr","product":"transit-router","label":"Transit Router","group":"sg","why":"Regional hub routing traffic between Express Connect and the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-tr","from":"ec","to":"tr","label":"VBR","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tr-cen","from":"tr","to":"cen","label":"attach","kind":"control"}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Migration VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cen-vpc","from":"cen","to":"vpc","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"say","text":"SMC copies your VMs to ECS, while DTS keeps databases in sync during cutover."}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Migrates on-prem VMs to ECS incrementally without downtime."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-smc","from":"dc","to":"smc","label":"VM copy","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"Data Transmission Service","group":"sg","why":"Syncs database changes from on-prem to cloud during migration."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-dts","from":"dc","to":"dts","label":"CDC sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"ecs","product":"ecs","label":"Migrated VMs","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Target ECS instances receiving migrated workloads across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"ebs","product":"ebs","label":"Cloud Disks","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ecs","why":"Block storage attached to migrated ECS instances."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-ecs","from":"smc","to":"ecs","label":"deploy","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-ecs","from":"dts","to":"ecs","label":"db sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes migration logs and operational events."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ecs-logs","from":"ecs","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mon","product":"cloudmonitor","label":"CloudMonitor","group":"sg","why":"Monitors ECS health and Express Connect link status."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ecs-mon","from":"ecs","to":"mon","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-premises Singapore DC linked via Express Connect through CEN, with SMC and DTS driving a phased VM migration to ECS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a secure multi-account landing zone with central identity, audit logging, threat detection and network firewalls."}
